    {
      "id": 1,
      "text": "Belle Fontaine’s name comes from French “Belle Fontaine,” meaning “beautiful spring,” named by 1698 explorers Pierre Le Moyne d’Iberville and Bienville.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7,
        25,
        19
